OL,3,GNEWSARussell T Davies says he gets
OL,4,Adaily hate messages for supporting
OL,5,Atrans rights
OL,6,
OL,7,FScreenwriter Russell T Davies has said
OL,8,Fhe gets called a "groomer" and a
OL,9,F"paedophile" every day by online trolls
OL,10,Fover his support of transgender rights.
OL,12,FThe Doctor Who writer said comments
OL,13,Fwere fuelled by his latest mini series
OL,14,FTipToe, which focuses on a feud between
OL,15,Fneighbours on opposite ends of the
OL,16,Fpolitical debate.
OL,18,FDavies described it as a reflection of
OL,19,F"real world issues" he felt necessary
OL,20,Fto speak up on and admitted he now has
OL,21,Fagents who monitor his hate "every
OL,22,Fday".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
