OL,3,GNEWSARussell T Davies says he gets
OL,4,Adaily hate messages for supporting
OL,5,Atrans rights
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I think the rise of the online voice,
OL,8,Fthe voice of anger, which is becoming
OL,9,Fmore homophobic and misogynist and
OL,10,Fanti-Semitic and every problem you
OL,11,Fcould name, is stepping out of the
OL,12,Fonline world into the real world," he
OL,13,Fsaid.
